              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None tuvuge iki? Enda tuvuge yukw abanyamahanga batākurikiye ivy’ ukugororoka bāshitse ku kugororoka, ni kwo kugororoka kuva ku kwizera: ",
          "type": "text",
