              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ku ki? N’uko batābironderesheje ukwizera, yamara bābironderesheje ibikorwa nk’ivyobibahesha, batsitara kuri rya buye ritsitaza, ",
          "type": "text",
